⚡️🇮🇱🇵🇸 Israeli Channel 13 published a story about Netanyahu receiving a security intelligence briefing claiming that Hamas is planning on conducting another operation “just like October 7th.”

This story is so obviously fake it’s quite pathetic. Last week, and the week before, various Israeli outlets also said they received intelligence that Iran would attack them. These fear-inducing stories are being spread to influence the upcoming election results. They expect their people to vote out of fear or anger.

@MedmanNews
